WEBVTT

00:14:28.796 --> 00:14:32.476
WA: Venti caramel frappe
with extra caramel drizzle, right?

00:14:32.516 --> 00:14:35.516
And I had now 20 dollars
became 10 dollars.

00:14:35.556 --> 00:14:38.436
I went home, and I told my grandmother,

00:14:38.476 --> 00:14:41.596
I said, "I've done
everything I possibly could.

00:14:41.636 --> 00:14:43.236
There's nothing else I can do.

00:14:43.276 --> 00:14:45.756
We have 10 bucks left, I'm sorry."

00:14:45.796 --> 00:14:49.436
I had some Dal Chawal that night
watched a Netflix movie.

00:14:49.476 --> 00:14:52.396
And I remember, I said this
in the book, I let go.

00:14:52.436 --> 00:14:53.996
There's nothing else I could do.

00:14:53.996 --> 00:14:55.196
I completely let go.

00:14:55.196 --> 00:14:58.316
I said, Allah, whatever happens,
Inshallah, I leave it up to you.

00:14:58.316 --> 00:15:00.276
I've done everything within my powers,